      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should probably go but i literally cant right now i'm stuck here. i just want to make sure i dont get something bad like tetanus or whatever. i have some hydrogen peroxide and some superglue in the house, can i just use those to clean it out and close the hole up? that seems faster and cleaner than waiting in a clinic for hours.",
