      "content": "but the saline is all the way in the garage and i dont even have any bandages left... i have some rubbing alcohol and some heavy duty antibiotic ointment i found in my medicine cabinet from like 2 years ago. if i just pour the alcohol in there to kill everything and then put a thick layer of that ointment on it and wrap it tight with a rag, that should be fine for tonight right? i really just need to get through this work session.",
